WEBVTT

00:01.724 --> 00:03.061
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.085 --> 00:04.420
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.444 --> 00:07.660
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.684 --> 00:13.244
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.244 --> 01:31.204
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.364 --> 01:34.604
=Episode 4=

01:38.304 --> 01:39.854
The belle is pretty.

01:41.579 --> 01:43.204
I'm reluctant to kill her.

01:48.354 --> 01:49.354
What to do now?

02:04.079 --> 02:05.643
I know it's hard for you

02:05.679 --> 02:06.684
to hide your sharpness.

02:09.479 --> 02:11.324
But I still despise you.

02:12.529 --> 02:13.529
I know it.

02:16.579 --> 02:18.979
Even if mountains and seas
come tumbling down,

02:19.554 --> 02:21.029
I will only meet them alone.

02:22.204 --> 02:23.564
If you don't have this courage,

02:24.579 --> 02:26.083
how can you take over North Liang?

02:29.604 --> 02:31.079
I didn't say I want to take over.

02:39.229 --> 02:40.540
If Xu Xiao passed away one day,

02:40.564 --> 02:41.680
leaving North Liang in a mess,

02:41.704 --> 02:43.300
will you want to take it over?

02:43.324 --> 02:44.324
With me here,

02:44.479 --> 02:46.029
North Liang won't be in a mess.

02:55.129 --> 02:56.129
Come out.

03:08.879 --> 03:09.581
See?

03:09.605 --> 03:10.829
He looks down upon you.

03:12.304 --> 03:13.304
Thanks.

03:15.504 --> 03:16.504
What do you mean?

03:17.079 --> 03:18.280
Judging from the atmosphere just now,

03:18.304 --> 03:19.420
you were afraid that he would hurt me,

03:19.444 --> 03:21.179
so you made some noise deliberately.

03:22.654 --> 03:23.764
Don't worry,

03:23.929 --> 03:25.004
he won't take any action.

03:25.379 --> 03:26.454
Nonsense!

03:26.724 --> 03:28.104
That was an accident.

03:29.054 --> 03:30.140
It's good if he attacked you.

03:30.164 --> 03:31.354
I could give him a hand.

03:32.054 --> 03:33.534
I think it's the day to dry my books.

03:34.004 --> 03:35.004
Where are they?

03:51.904 --> 03:52.899
The book is broken.

03:52.923 --> 03:54.704
You should pay for it.

03:59.004 --> 04:00.123
Isn't that reasonable?

04:01.879 --> 04:02.879
Where are you going?

04:03.504 --> 04:04.679
To get my coin box!

04:16.904 --> 04:18.204
You feel better now?

04:21.854 --> 04:23.529
Ning Emei is a frank guy.

04:23.879 --> 04:25.004
Give him a reason

04:25.154 --> 04:26.154
and let him go.

04:26.854 --> 04:29.429
The assassination isn't done yet.

04:30.779 --> 04:32.004
Next time,

04:32.454 --> 04:34.324
we'll know who is behind.

04:38.124 --> 04:39.564
Chen Zhibao

04:40.754 --> 04:41.779
is talented

04:42.204 --> 04:42.781
and handsome.

04:42.805 --> 04:44.154
Even I

04:44.329 --> 04:46.129
can't compare with him.

04:48.054 --> 04:49.679
You're being humble.

04:50.529 --> 04:51.564
He has his tricks

04:51.764 --> 04:53.104
but you have your own schemes.

04:56.954 --> 04:58.259
After you take charge of North Liang,

04:58.283 --> 04:59.929
he is the first one you should subdue.

05:00.179 --> 05:01.404
It's a little difficult.

05:03.154 --> 05:04.629
I'm just a playboy.

05:04.979 --> 05:06.723
How can I take such a responsibility?

05:07.804 --> 05:08.843
And you just told me

05:09.254 --> 05:10.101
that next assassination

05:10.125 --> 05:11.604
will happen anytime.

05:13.404 --> 05:14.804
I should stay alive for now.

05:23.757 --> 05:26.904
(Third Graduate in the Palace Examination
Mr. Lin)

05:27.554 --> 05:30.104
(Retainer Miss Fan)

05:31.779 --> 05:32.899
After we arrive in Lingzhou,

05:33.079 --> 05:34.079
we should be apart.

05:38.304 --> 05:39.304
Why?

05:41.179 --> 05:42.604
Did I do anything wrong?

05:47.229 --> 05:48.004
As you know,

05:48.129 --> 05:50.324
I'm going to Lingzhou for Xu Fengnian.

05:50.979 --> 05:52.179
You shouldn't be involved

05:52.354 --> 05:53.354
in such big trouble.

05:54.729 --> 05:55.929
No matter what you do,

05:56.454 --> 05:57.854
I'm willing to be by your side.

06:04.404 --> 06:05.404
Lin,

06:06.954 --> 06:08.083
don't you trust me?

06:08.679 --> 06:09.679
Yes.

06:11.729 --> 06:12.924
I'm just touched.

06:21.629 --> 06:24.979
(Tingchao Pavilion)

06:38.004 --> 06:39.004
Why don't you get in?

06:40.329 --> 06:41.329
We had a deal.

06:41.379 --> 06:42.379
I'll get in only when

06:42.829 --> 06:44.189
I finish my job as your bodyguard.

06:45.404 --> 06:46.579
Don't make it so rigid.

06:46.603 --> 06:47.603
You can get in now.

06:49.379 --> 06:50.404
Now?

06:51.104 --> 06:52.104
Wait a moment.

07:02.754 --> 07:03.804
What is it?

07:04.354 --> 07:05.354
Grilled chicken.

07:06.329 --> 07:07.649
Why did you throw it in the lake?

07:09.304 --> 07:10.354
Come on, let's get in.

07:17.304 --> 07:21.004
(Tingchao Pavilion)

07:27.729 --> 07:30.130
(Tingchao Pavilion)

07:30.154 --> 07:30.819
Come on!

07:30.843 --> 07:31.843
I'll lead you.

07:48.904 --> 07:51.105
On the first floor, there are
30,000 volumes of basic martial arts,

07:51.129 --> 07:52.529
at which you may turn your nose up.

07:52.929 --> 07:53.929
30,000 volumes?

07:54.379 --> 07:55.830
On the second floor, there are
4,000 unique copies of

07:55.854 --> 07:56.579
Yin Yang theory and debating,

07:56.603 --> 07:58.204
and also 49 great weapons.

07:58.904 --> 08:00.660
On the third floor, there are
20,000 volumes of precious secret books

08:00.684 --> 08:02.105
which can be considered as profound.

08:02.129 --> 08:03.900
The fourth floor is full of antiques,

08:03.924 --> 08:04.861
in which you may not be interested.

08:04.885 --> 08:06.380
Don't go to the fifth
and sixth floor for now.

08:06.404 --> 08:07.964
I need to ask for Xu Xiao's permission.

08:08.054 --> 08:09.494
There are so many books and weapons,

08:09.854 --> 08:11.155
but why don't you know martial arts?

08:11.179 --> 08:12.579
The academy is full of moral articles.

08:12.603 --> 08:13.923
Why are there still many rascals?

08:14.079 --> 08:15.129
That's different.

08:17.929 --> 08:18.929
I'm lazy.

08:19.454 --> 08:21.764
The son of a Lord
can't suffer from this.

08:23.244 --> 08:24.579
I'm afraid the army won't obey you

08:24.603 --> 08:26.203
if you don't have the strength to fight.

08:28.523 --> 08:30.643
You also want to persuade me
to take over North Liang?

08:31.329 --> 08:32.449
Whether you take over or not

08:32.704 --> 08:33.763
has nothing to do with me.

08:35.604 --> 08:36.604
That's fine.

08:38.054 --> 08:38.660
Alright,

08:38.684 --> 08:39.300
take your time.

08:39.324 --> 08:40.324
I'm leaving.

08:43.079 --> 08:44.079
Oh,

08:44.129 --> 08:45.404
I need to tell him.

08:47.279 --> 08:48.279
Grandpa Wei!

08:50.604 --> 08:51.804
Grandpa Wei!

08:55.479 --> 08:56.479
Let me borrow your sword.

09:06.204 --> 09:07.644
Dry weather!

09:07.904 --> 09:09.404
Beware of fire!

09:09.629 --> 09:10.979
Dry weather!

09:11.129 --> 09:11.699
Xu Fengnian!

09:11.723 --> 09:12.524
Beware of fire!

09:12.654 --> 09:13.660
Stop knocking!

09:13.684 --> 09:14.723
Xu Fengnian,

09:14.804 --> 09:16.604
are you trying to kill me?

09:30.524 --> 09:31.939
Your Highness,

09:31.963 --> 09:32.963
greetings

09:33.229 --> 09:34.554
to you.

09:36.354 --> 09:37.704
This is Grandpa Wei.

09:38.604 --> 09:40.629
You can ask him for the books you want.

09:41.104 --> 09:42.679
This is Nangong Puye.

09:42.779 --> 09:43.819
She is here to read books.

09:44.123 --> 09:44.699
Nangong?

09:44.723 --> 09:45.660
(Tingchao Pavilion Wei Shuyang)

09:45.684 --> 09:47.140
(Tingchao Pavilion Wei Shuyang)
The family from North Mang?

09:47.164 --> 09:48.164
Xu Xiao knows her.

09:48.829 --> 09:49.529
Oh,

09:49.779 --> 09:50.879
then that's alright.

09:51.254 --> 09:51.963
I'm leaving then.

09:52.179 --> 09:53.254
Wait, Your Highness.

09:56.204 --> 09:57.354
Since you're back,

09:57.954 --> 09:59.594
won't you go upstairs
to meet your master?

10:04.279 --> 10:05.404
I can't meet him now.

10:06.079 --> 10:07.079
Why?

10:07.779 --> 10:08.780
The assassination

10:08.804 --> 10:09.954
is planned by someone.

10:10.304 --> 10:11.454
Before I find it out,

10:11.579 --> 10:12.619
I feel ashamed to see him.

10:13.229 --> 10:14.229
Master?

10:15.354 --> 10:16.794
You don't know martial arts, do you?

10:18.129 --> 10:20.284
My master doesn't teach me martial arts.

10:21.104 --> 10:22.224
What does he teach you then?

10:23.723 --> 10:24.723
Chess.

10:41.204 --> 10:43.044
Who is this? What a big scene.

10:43.604 --> 10:44.604
Yeah.

10:47.479 --> 10:48.479
What's going on?

10:53.954 --> 10:54.605
It's Lin!

10:54.629 --> 10:55.281
Yes. Right.

10:55.305 --> 10:56.530
His family is in charge of

10:56.554 --> 10:57.755
the financial affairs in Qingzhou.

10:57.779 --> 10:58.888
It's a great honor

10:58.912 --> 11:00.554
to his family to have such a scholar!

11:01.279 --> 11:01.955
Who is this?

11:01.979 --> 11:02.979
I don't know.

11:03.604 --> 11:04.405
Have you ever seen him?

11:04.429 --> 11:05.429
- Thanks.
- No.

11:05.854 --> 11:07.054
Come on. Let's go have a look.

11:11.229 --> 11:12.229
Is it him?

11:14.079 --> 11:15.079
Ladies and gentlemen,

11:16.564 --> 11:19.104
I have something to say.

11:19.483 --> 11:20.483
Please stay

11:21.529 --> 11:22.529
and listen to me.

11:22.779 --> 11:23.606
What is he talking about?

11:23.630 --> 11:25.154
What? I don't understand.

11:27.229 --> 11:28.229
Xu Xiao,

11:29.284 --> 11:30.459
known as the Lord of North Liang,

11:30.483 --> 11:32.020
is actually a rebel!

11:32.044 --> 11:33.219
That's a big problem!

11:33.243 --> 11:34.480
He is a brutal maniac

11:34.504 --> 11:35.780
who should be punished by all.

11:35.804 --> 11:37.004
This is a capital crime!

11:39.629 --> 11:41.763
He is ferocious and violent,

11:42.129 --> 11:43.260
but he has achieved

11:43.284 --> 11:44.429
war success.

11:45.154 --> 11:46.779
The most disgraceful

11:48.704 --> 11:50.104
is the eldest son of the Xu Family,

11:50.904 --> 11:51.980
Xu Fengnian!

11:52.004 --> 11:52.740
The son of Lord of North Liang

11:52.764 --> 11:53.819
is greedy, lustful,

11:53.843 --> 11:55.180
- as vicious as a viper.
- What a deep grudge does he have?

11:55.204 --> 11:56.444
Such an evil person

11:56.579 --> 11:57.963
with bad intentions

11:58.054 --> 12:00.260
is really the biggest human disaster

12:00.284 --> 12:02.804
and the biggest trouble in the world!

12:08.979 --> 12:09.739
Here you are.

12:09.763 --> 12:10.763
Let's go out together.

12:10.954 --> 12:11.954
No.

12:12.429 --> 12:14.304
I heard someone is scolding me
in the street.

12:15.554 --> 12:16.554
Really?

12:16.604 --> 12:17.780
Why should I lie to you?

12:17.804 --> 12:19.363
And it's said that guy is literary,

12:19.504 --> 12:20.540
scolding me for hours

12:20.564 --> 12:21.564
without repeating words.

12:22.304 --> 12:23.304
I don't believe it.

12:23.579 --> 12:24.501
If someone scolded you in the street,

12:24.525 --> 12:25.979
he or she would be arrested already.

12:26.729 --> 12:29.339
He is the third graduate
in the imperial examination.

12:29.363 --> 12:30.755
No one dares to arrest him.

12:30.779 --> 12:32.305
The third graduate

12:32.329 --> 12:33.979
came to Lingzhou to scold you
in the street?

12:34.003 --> 12:34.820
Yeah!

12:34.844 --> 12:35.859
It's once in a blue moon.

12:35.883 --> 12:36.883
Come on!

12:38.243 --> 12:39.620
I need to learn something from him.

12:39.644 --> 12:40.644
Let's go.

12:41.629 --> 12:42.780
Old Huang, why are you coming?

12:42.804 --> 12:44.004
I'll go watch the fun.

12:44.204 --> 12:45.524
Old Huang likes watching the fun.

12:47.954 --> 12:48.901
Aren't you being scolded?

12:48.925 --> 12:50.054
Why do you look so happy?

12:51.329 --> 12:52.954
I like watching the fun, too!

12:55.954 --> 12:56.620
Hurry up!

12:56.644 --> 12:57.459
Or it'll be over.

12:57.483 --> 12:58.483
Come on.

13:00.104 --> 13:01.629
If there is a righteous gentleman

13:02.029 --> 13:03.709
who can't bear to see
that harrowing scene,

13:04.179 --> 13:05.754
how can he sit idly by?

13:05.879 --> 13:06.739
What is he talking about?

13:06.763 --> 13:07.740
We should be outraged!

13:07.764 --> 13:09.130
- Defend our world,
- I don't understand.

13:09.154 --> 13:10.219
- Speak righteously
- He must be scolding.

13:10.243 --> 13:11.530
- To show our attitude!
- Yeah.

13:11.554 --> 13:12.564
I can't understand.

13:14.754 --> 13:15.531
Lin.

13:15.555 --> 13:16.875
I can't understand a word of him.

13:18.304 --> 13:19.304
He even gets thirsty.

13:19.754 --> 13:20.754
I don't understand.

13:23.004 --> 13:23.655
Excuse me.

13:23.679 --> 13:24.304
Coming through.

13:24.579 --> 13:25.430
He is the third scholar?

13:25.454 --> 13:26.454
Yeah.

13:26.954 --> 13:28.714
What is he talking about?
I don't understand.

13:30.929 --> 13:31.929
Thanks.

13:33.779 --> 13:35.659
He even dares to talk about
Lord of North Liang.

13:35.883 --> 13:36.883
Ladies and gentlemen,

13:37.229 --> 13:38.605
- This lady looks pretty.
- I've scolded him for long.

13:38.629 --> 13:39.679
I'd like to ask you

13:40.379 --> 13:41.924
if you know why

13:42.254 --> 13:44.363
the shameless Xu Fengnian

13:44.604 --> 13:46.843
can do harm to Lingzhou?

13:47.529 --> 13:48.330
Why?

13:48.354 --> 13:49.004
Say it!

13:49.179 --> 13:50.179
Go ahead!

13:50.329 --> 13:51.854
Up to the situation now,

13:52.479 --> 13:53.479
it's still because of

13:53.929 --> 13:55.444
the rebellious villain,

13:55.603 --> 13:57.083
Xu Xiao!

13:57.804 --> 13:58.843
He is bold.

14:02.054 --> 14:03.204
The country's etiquette

14:04.363 --> 14:05.879
and moral model

14:06.929 --> 14:08.230
are all ruined by him.

14:08.254 --> 14:10.029
What is he saying? Too bookish.

14:10.129 --> 14:11.059
Xu Xiao!

14:11.083 --> 14:11.680
Old Huang.

14:11.704 --> 14:12.206
Yes?

14:12.230 --> 14:14.150
- What do you think?
- He used the military power

14:14.704 --> 14:16.420
- He is not scolding well.
- To ignore the imperial decree!

14:16.444 --> 14:17.444
Why?

14:17.854 --> 14:18.854
No one can understand.

14:18.954 --> 14:20.655
Scolding without dirty words

14:20.679 --> 14:21.404
is so boring.

14:21.504 --> 14:22.380
- That's right.
- This guy

14:22.404 --> 14:23.261
is really the serious trouble

14:23.285 --> 14:24.500
of Liyang

14:24.524 --> 14:26.654
and the traitor of the country!

14:27.679 --> 14:28.679
Ouch!

14:29.254 --> 14:31.054
- You brat!
- What happened?

14:31.963 --> 14:33.444
How cruel you are!

14:33.779 --> 14:35.080
You're running over me!

14:35.104 --> 14:36.660
He broke the elder's leg.

14:36.684 --> 14:37.955
My carriage didn't move!

14:37.979 --> 14:39.324
Get up first!

14:40.329 --> 14:41.329
My hand!

14:42.429 --> 14:43.963
My hand is broken, too!

14:44.843 --> 14:45.900
I didn't move!

14:45.924 --> 14:46.580
The carriage is parked!

14:46.604 --> 14:47.979
Everyone saw it!

14:48.003 --> 14:49.804
My carriage didn't even move!

14:49.979 --> 14:51.660
Everyone saw it!

14:51.684 --> 14:54.579
My eyes also get blind!

14:55.054 --> 14:56.582
They even made him blind!

14:56.606 --> 14:58.059
You said we ran over your leg.

14:58.083 --> 14:59.620
- How did your eyes get blind?
- How?

14:59.644 --> 15:02.154
They got blind from pain!

15:02.529 --> 15:03.580
His eyes even got blind.

15:03.604 --> 15:04.880
I know this guy!

15:04.904 --> 15:05.700
How cruel is he!

15:05.724 --> 15:06.779
Old Xu.

15:07.854 --> 15:08.854
Old Xu.

15:09.029 --> 15:10.679
Cheating for money?

15:11.004 --> 15:12.004
See?

15:12.654 --> 15:13.880
Look how poor the old man is.

15:13.904 --> 15:14.501
Xu?

15:14.525 --> 15:15.580
(Cavalryman of Yugu Battalion Xu Yongguan)
Yeah.

15:15.604 --> 15:16.180
Come on.

15:16.204 --> 15:17.280
Let's talk when we're back.

15:17.304 --> 15:18.454
I'm not done yet.

15:19.804 --> 15:20.580
Xu,

15:21.843 --> 15:23.043
he is the third scholar.

15:24.779 --> 15:26.430
He is rich.

15:26.454 --> 15:27.256
How dare he offend him?

15:27.280 --> 15:28.729
But he is bullying.

15:29.729 --> 15:31.605
He needs to be sent to jail.

15:31.629 --> 15:32.606
He can't escape.

15:32.630 --> 15:33.155
Yeah.

15:33.179 --> 15:34.255
- Hold on a second.
- Don't try to escape!

15:34.279 --> 15:36.243
Where is he?

15:38.904 --> 15:39.904
Here.

15:50.679 --> 15:51.729
Stop that!

15:52.754 --> 15:54.324
Without the North Liang Army,

15:54.363 --> 15:56.954
the world wouldn't be in peace like now!

15:57.179 --> 15:58.620
You are not grateful

15:58.644 --> 16:00.354
for the favor of peace.

16:00.379 --> 16:01.579
Shame on you!

16:01.603 --> 16:02.164
Nonsense!

16:02.603 --> 16:03.531
Don't touch me!

16:03.555 --> 16:05.779
My eyes are blinded by your touch!

16:06.363 --> 16:07.100
My eyes!

16:07.124 --> 16:08.180
- My eyes!
- Come on.

16:08.204 --> 16:09.060
Let's go back home.

16:09.084 --> 16:10.279
Sorry. Sorry.

16:10.479 --> 16:11.500
- Why are we leaving now?
- Let's go home.

16:11.524 --> 16:12.929
Let's go home and have some drinks.

16:13.004 --> 16:14.004
Come on.

16:14.204 --> 16:15.404
How poor he is.

16:15.579 --> 16:16.859
So boring.

16:16.883 --> 16:17.905
What a rascal he is!

16:17.929 --> 16:19.260
No play to watch.

16:19.284 --> 16:20.339
What a bust.

16:20.363 --> 16:21.363
How boring!

16:21.629 --> 16:22.924
They got spoiled.

16:23.723 --> 16:24.723
Let's go.

16:26.954 --> 16:27.723
Scholar,

16:27.804 --> 16:28.804
you'd better go now.

16:29.004 --> 16:30.055
- Or you may get caught
- What to do now?

16:30.079 --> 16:31.099
By the government.

16:31.123 --> 16:31.900
That's right.

16:31.924 --> 16:32.860
Go now.

16:32.884 --> 16:35.044
- Or you'll get arrested!
- He will be sooner or later.

16:36.129 --> 16:37.644
The scholars have their own bearing.

16:39.004 --> 16:40.104
Since I have scolded him,

16:40.679 --> 16:42.279
I might as well face the rebel directly.

16:43.004 --> 16:44.004
Miss Fan,

16:47.554 --> 16:49.354
let's go to the Mansion
of Lord of North Liang

16:49.729 --> 16:51.379
to blame Xu Fengnian face to face.

16:53.379 --> 16:54.379
Alright.

16:54.479 --> 16:55.579
I'll be with you

16:55.854 --> 16:56.854
wherever you go.

17:01.154 --> 17:02.154
Stop running!

17:02.654 --> 17:03.654
Stop!

17:04.904 --> 17:06.154
Old Huang, get it!

17:07.104 --> 17:08.404
Have you caught it?

17:10.029 --> 17:10.939
Wait a second!

17:10.963 --> 17:11.654
We have blocked it.

17:11.779 --> 17:12.979
You can't even catch a duck.

17:13.003 --> 17:14.003
Idiot!

17:14.054 --> 17:15.279
He is an idiot.

17:23.554 --> 17:24.723
I need to get a tool.

17:25.164 --> 17:26.229
I'll go get a tool.

17:27.204 --> 17:28.204
Stop there!

17:28.779 --> 17:29.829
Stop waving.

17:30.554 --> 17:32.029
It's because of the war.

17:32.523 --> 17:33.644
I'm really blind.

17:34.379 --> 17:35.379
Ah.

17:36.004 --> 17:37.963
How do you know I'm waving my hand?

17:38.279 --> 17:39.604
You even made a wind.

17:42.079 --> 17:42.860
I got it!

17:42.884 --> 17:43.884
Stew it!

17:44.204 --> 17:45.524
There are drinks inside the room.

17:46.204 --> 17:47.455
Leave it to me.

17:47.479 --> 17:48.684
The kitchen is over there.

17:48.929 --> 17:49.563
Alright!

17:49.704 --> 17:50.341
Wait a moment!

17:50.365 --> 17:51.685
Let me make it delicious for you!

17:57.779 --> 17:59.644
I haven't seen you for years.

17:59.803 --> 18:01.763
I guess you got married.

18:02.754 --> 18:03.924
I thought,

18:04.429 --> 18:06.364
who would be so unlucky

18:06.554 --> 18:08.323
as to marry a brat like you?

18:10.529 --> 18:12.963
I didn't expect that you really got one.

18:13.054 --> 18:14.243
She is great.

18:14.679 --> 18:16.660
She sounds cute and pretty.

18:16.684 --> 18:18.084
That's a great scolding.

18:18.229 --> 18:19.229
Um-hmm.

18:20.924 --> 18:21.620
I'm not!

18:21.644 --> 18:22.644
I didn't marry him!

18:23.229 --> 18:24.844
Xu Fengnian! Say something!

18:25.029 --> 18:26.109
We haven't got married yet.

18:26.254 --> 18:27.254
Ah?

18:27.829 --> 18:29.789
You already stay together
without getting married?

18:30.204 --> 18:32.563
Do her parents agree?

18:32.879 --> 18:34.900
No! We're not together!

18:34.924 --> 18:36.243
Her parents passed away.

18:37.629 --> 18:39.570
Then, you must treat her nicely.

18:39.844 --> 18:42.429
Don't break her heart.

18:42.829 --> 18:43.820
You!

18:43.844 --> 18:44.779
Skip our business.

18:44.803 --> 18:45.421
Let's talk about you.

18:45.445 --> 18:46.884
What our business?

18:47.454 --> 18:48.299
Xu.

18:48.323 --> 18:48.861
Ah.

18:48.885 --> 18:50.003
It's been years

18:50.379 --> 18:51.444
and you become generous.

18:51.629 --> 18:53.644
You even treat us
with the duck you raised.

18:54.454 --> 18:55.779
I don't raise ducks.

18:57.379 --> 18:58.499
What is the duck we caught then?

18:58.523 --> 19:00.204
It belongs to my neighbor.

19:00.529 --> 19:01.829
It just came to visit.

19:03.329 --> 19:04.404
Old Huang!

19:05.854 --> 19:06.884
What's wrong?

19:09.354 --> 19:10.644
I'm plucking it.

19:12.004 --> 19:13.004
Nothing.

19:13.379 --> 19:14.219
Remember the salt.

19:14.243 --> 19:15.243
Got it.

19:17.429 --> 19:18.483
You caught it.

19:18.929 --> 19:20.004
You pay for it.

19:23.804 --> 19:24.924
You deserve it.

19:25.704 --> 19:28.554
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

19:38.154 --> 19:38.980
Wait, Miss Fan.

19:39.004 --> 19:40.004
Um?

19:51.054 --> 19:52.444
Lin Family from Hedong

19:52.654 --> 19:53.855
is here to visit

19:53.879 --> 19:56.399
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)
the son of Lord of North Liang.

20:09.104 --> 20:10.529
Lin Family from Hedong

20:10.804 --> 20:13.279
is here to visit
the son of Lord of North Liang.

20:25.529 --> 20:26.963
Lin Family from Hedong

20:27.404 --> 20:28.884
is here to visit

20:29.179 --> 20:30.679
the son of Lord of North Liang!

20:38.924 --> 20:40.204
Here is Lin's visiting card!

20:40.854 --> 20:42.494
(Third Graduate
in the Palace Examination)

20:52.154 --> 20:53.563
Why doesn't anyone take this?

20:55.004 --> 20:56.084
Let's wait a little longer.

20:56.679 --> 20:58.060
Perhaps the name of my family

20:58.084 --> 20:59.124
shocked the concierge.

20:59.379 --> 21:00.963
So he's rushing back to inform them.

21:03.454 --> 21:04.729
How rude they are!

21:06.124 --> 21:07.454
Men of prowess

21:08.154 --> 21:09.380
know nothing about etiquette.

21:09.404 --> 21:10.830
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

21:10.854 --> 21:12.884
Coming!

21:12.979 --> 21:15.404
Here comes the duck!

21:18.723 --> 21:19.723
Here.

21:23.104 --> 21:24.104
Hey!

21:27.754 --> 21:28.754
You want it?

21:29.204 --> 21:30.204
Take it away!

21:31.379 --> 21:32.019
What's going on?

21:32.043 --> 21:33.123
What are they fighting for?

21:33.229 --> 21:34.229
The leg.

21:44.529 --> 21:45.529
Lass,

21:46.554 --> 21:47.554
have it.

21:53.129 --> 21:54.279
Xu,

21:55.879 --> 21:57.929
stop fooling around.

21:58.704 --> 22:00.043
Learn some skills

22:00.329 --> 22:02.563
or open a shop.

22:02.904 --> 22:03.604
Don't

22:03.629 --> 22:06.404
let the girl suffer with you.

22:11.879 --> 22:13.003
I see.

22:13.229 --> 22:14.483
Just eat the duck.

22:34.884 --> 22:36.084
Lin Family from Hedong is here

22:36.198 --> 22:37.838
to visit His highness, Xu Fengnian.

22:47.179 --> 22:49.219
You're the scholar
who shouted abuses in the street?

22:50.679 --> 22:52.429
If His Highness is not convinced,

22:52.579 --> 22:54.229
he can argue with me face to face.

22:56.929 --> 22:58.043
His Highness is not home.

23:06.704 --> 23:07.704
Hey!

23:09.004 --> 23:10.754
Open the door and let us wait inside!

23:17.979 --> 23:21.729
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

23:38.379 --> 23:39.884
You're a veteran?

23:40.329 --> 23:41.329
Um.

23:41.754 --> 23:44.019
I'm from Yugu Battalion,

23:44.043 --> 23:45.754
a time-honored battalion in Jinzhou.

23:47.954 --> 23:48.954
You have

23:49.254 --> 23:50.604
fought a lot of battles?

23:51.804 --> 23:53.004
Of course.

23:53.879 --> 23:56.230
Back then, all the states
were in chaotic wars.

23:56.254 --> 23:57.523
I've met

23:57.604 --> 23:59.404
almost all the battles.

24:01.554 --> 24:02.844
Forget about it.

24:03.354 --> 24:05.304
Now the world is pacified.

24:05.723 --> 24:07.243
Why bother to recall that?

24:09.454 --> 24:12.444
Xu looks unreliable,

24:12.884 --> 24:14.124
but he is kind inside.

24:15.154 --> 24:16.684
You made the right choice.

24:17.854 --> 24:21.454
He is a good boy for life.

24:27.754 --> 24:29.579
What a brat.

24:40.029 --> 24:41.054
How about

24:41.529 --> 24:43.204
getting back to the carriage?

24:44.404 --> 24:45.884
They have no manners

24:46.804 --> 24:48.644
but we have to keep our proper sense.

24:52.979 --> 24:53.979
Lin,

24:54.829 --> 24:57.444
why do you hate Xu Fengnian so much?

24:58.204 --> 25:01.054
Now the three northern states
only obey the Xu Family

25:01.654 --> 25:03.084
but not the royal power.

25:07.154 --> 25:10.444
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)
That's the potential problem.

25:10.884 --> 25:12.844
Once a villain like Xu Fengnian

25:13.429 --> 25:15.129
is in charge of the world,

25:20.729 --> 25:23.364
the world will be devastated.

25:24.629 --> 25:25.879
If I know martial arts,

25:27.254 --> 25:29.003
I'll kill him myself

25:29.929 --> 25:32.529
to eliminate the hidden trouble
for the world.

25:52.924 --> 25:54.924
He doesn't know you're Xu Fengnian?

25:56.904 --> 25:58.140
He is Old Xu

25:58.164 --> 25:59.180
and I'm just Xu.

25:59.204 --> 26:00.204
That's great.

26:03.124 --> 26:05.243
He fought for your family,

26:05.354 --> 26:07.003
but look what life he is living now.

26:07.979 --> 26:09.164
You owe him a lot.

26:10.479 --> 26:11.479
Yeah.

26:12.229 --> 26:13.644
My family owes him

26:13.879 --> 26:14.879
and all of them.

26:15.779 --> 26:16.500
So

26:16.524 --> 26:18.444
We can only repay them a peaceful world.

26:20.529 --> 26:21.860
Why don't you tell him

26:21.884 --> 26:23.079
you're the son of the Lord?

26:26.579 --> 26:27.381
So many people in this world

26:27.405 --> 26:28.963
can live well

26:29.254 --> 26:31.084
just because these people

26:31.554 --> 26:32.554
are dead,

26:32.704 --> 26:33.340
wounded,

26:33.364 --> 26:34.364
and disabled.

26:34.929 --> 26:36.340
So, my status as His Highness

26:36.364 --> 26:37.300
means nothing

26:37.324 --> 26:38.354
in front of them.

26:39.104 --> 26:40.104
I'm

26:41.129 --> 26:42.483
just a brat.

26:56.604 --> 26:57.844
No war.

26:58.579 --> 27:00.179
So great.

27:15.579 --> 27:17.323
Isn't that the scholar who scolded you?

27:23.129 --> 27:24.723
Oh, you're Mr. Lin.

27:25.604 --> 27:26.830
The old man who caused trouble

27:26.854 --> 27:28.079
was taken away by him.

27:32.004 --> 27:32.980
Thank you

27:33.004 --> 27:34.124
for helping me out just now.

27:34.954 --> 27:36.529
Mr. Lin, what are you

27:36.729 --> 27:37.539
waiting for here?

27:37.563 --> 27:38.563
None of your business!

27:41.043 --> 27:42.379
Visit His Highness.

27:43.179 --> 27:44.283
Why don't you get in?

27:45.323 --> 27:46.204
They have no manners

27:46.304 --> 27:47.629
and don't know about hospitality.

27:48.079 --> 27:49.079
Oh.

27:59.254 --> 28:00.739
- They didn't take our visiting card.
- Open the door!

28:00.763 --> 28:02.204
It's of no use to knock at the door.

28:09.304 --> 28:10.164
Come on.

28:10.204 --> 28:11.204
Come inside.

28:43.504 --> 28:44.544
Why are you looking at me?

28:45.554 --> 28:46.684
Pretty.

28:47.604 --> 28:48.804
You must be a good wife.

28:49.054 --> 28:49.805
You!

28:49.829 --> 28:50.829
Old Huang.

28:53.054 --> 28:53.880
Young Master.

28:53.904 --> 28:56.079
I can help you if you like her.

28:58.304 --> 29:00.243
I'm afraid you can't.

29:00.354 --> 29:01.354
Shameless.

29:01.644 --> 29:03.554
How could you scold Old Huang?

29:04.154 --> 29:05.254
I'm scolding you!

29:15.329 --> 29:16.329
What?

29:16.854 --> 29:17.905
Go tell Qingniao

29:17.929 --> 29:19.009
to wait for me by the lake.

29:21.054 --> 29:22.054
No.

29:22.124 --> 29:22.844
You have taken my money.

29:22.979 --> 29:23.979
Go.

29:25.854 --> 29:26.854
Or give it back to me.

29:34.679 --> 29:36.844
Are you one of them here?

29:37.154 --> 29:38.154
Kind of.

29:39.379 --> 29:41.043
Looks like you're also literate.

29:41.154 --> 29:42.444
Do you know

29:42.554 --> 29:43.820
who is the top villain in Liyang?

29:43.844 --> 29:45.104
Xu Xiao.

29:47.763 --> 29:49.283
Since you know his sin,

29:49.454 --> 29:50.754
why do you offer service to him?

29:51.084 --> 29:52.554
I'm not offering service.

29:53.179 --> 29:54.763
My father lives here.

29:54.829 --> 29:55.829
I have no choice.

29:56.304 --> 29:57.860
Your father is Xu's assistant?

29:57.884 --> 29:58.904
Not that capable.

29:58.963 --> 29:59.780
Guard?

29:59.804 --> 30:01.100
He is too old to do that.

30:01.124 --> 30:01.740
Then…

30:01.764 --> 30:02.929
Maybe the steward.

30:03.679 --> 30:04.679
Oh.

30:04.879 --> 30:06.140
Since you often stay here,

30:06.164 --> 30:07.499
have you ever met Xu Fengnian?

30:07.523 --> 30:08.523
I met him often.

30:09.429 --> 30:11.204
What do you think of him?

30:13.929 --> 30:14.939
So-so.

30:14.963 --> 30:15.963
Kind of a rascal.

30:18.054 --> 30:20.254
I didn't expect you to be in danger

30:20.329 --> 30:21.889
but still dare to speak up for justice!

30:22.929 --> 30:23.756
Liyang

30:23.780 --> 30:25.939
still has hope for having
such a young person

30:25.963 --> 30:27.043
of noble aspirations.

30:27.179 --> 30:28.604
I feel flattered.

30:28.854 --> 30:29.661
Since you're always here,

30:29.685 --> 30:31.705
can you tell me the details

30:31.729 --> 30:34.204
about how greedy
and lustful Xu Fengnian is?

30:49.954 --> 30:50.954
Here they are.

31:05.079 --> 31:06.319
Where is Xu Fengnian?

31:06.779 --> 31:07.740
The playboy

31:07.764 --> 31:09.684
always shows up with girls around.

31:09.854 --> 31:10.854
Keep cool.

31:14.884 --> 31:15.884
Take your seat.

31:20.003 --> 31:20.739
He hasn't come.

31:20.763 --> 31:21.763
No hurry.

31:23.804 --> 31:25.299
Aren't you here for Xu Fengnian?

31:25.323 --> 31:26.483
Who else are you waiting for?

31:26.729 --> 31:27.381
Yes.

31:27.405 --> 31:29.154
I'm waiting for him.

31:30.729 --> 31:31.729
Here I am.

31:35.079 --> 31:36.079
What did he say?

31:37.604 --> 31:39.084
He said he is Xu Fengnian.

31:41.454 --> 31:42.454
Who are you?

31:42.729 --> 31:44.879
Son of Lord of North Liang, Xu Fengnian.

31:47.554 --> 31:48.939
Mr. Lin, you're so cute.

31:48.963 --> 31:50.355
You spoke contrary to your thought.

31:50.379 --> 31:51.939
You pretended to scold me in the street

31:51.963 --> 31:54.179
but think so highly of me in mind.

31:55.229 --> 31:56.469
When did I think highly of you?

31:56.904 --> 31:58.420
Liyang just needs such a young person

31:58.444 --> 31:59.563
of noble aspirations.

31:59.604 --> 32:00.723
Didn't you say that?

32:01.529 --> 32:02.854
Are you really Xu Fengnian?

32:03.803 --> 32:05.243
Do you think there is anyone else

32:05.429 --> 32:06.924
who would dare to pretend to be him?

32:07.154 --> 32:08.884
Then, you're making fun of us?

32:12.229 --> 32:13.604
You wanted to get in,

32:13.729 --> 32:15.054
so I let you in.

32:15.483 --> 32:16.300
You scolded Xu Xiao,

32:16.324 --> 32:17.364
I went along.

32:17.604 --> 32:18.820
You asked to see Xu Fengnian,

32:18.844 --> 32:20.579
so I prepared seats by the lake.

32:20.854 --> 32:22.219
Why do you say

32:22.243 --> 32:23.243
I'm making fun of you?

32:24.754 --> 32:25.900
You concealed your identity.

32:25.924 --> 32:26.979
You're insidious and treacherous!

32:27.003 --> 32:28.003
No more verbal arguments.

32:29.504 --> 32:30.739
If you are Xu Fengnian,

32:30.763 --> 32:32.084
do you know that

32:32.604 --> 32:33.381
North Liang's leadership

32:33.405 --> 32:35.084
is in the period of stagnation?

32:35.679 --> 32:37.180
Your family occupies three states

32:37.204 --> 32:38.444
and gets the military power.

32:38.604 --> 32:39.929
What is your purpose?

32:41.629 --> 32:42.629
Xu Fengnian!

32:42.829 --> 32:44.860
If you still have a sense of loyalty,

32:44.884 --> 32:46.124
you should reflect on yourself!

32:49.029 --> 32:50.104
What did you say

32:50.529 --> 32:51.604
to this lady just now?

32:54.124 --> 32:55.723
No more verbal arguments.

32:56.763 --> 32:58.483
Isn't this verbal argument
you're talking?

33:00.454 --> 33:01.454
Mr. Lin,

33:01.704 --> 33:02.704
to scold,

33:03.404 --> 33:04.539
you should speak dirty words.

33:04.563 --> 33:05.563
You!

33:14.523 --> 33:16.803
Looks like you won't come around.

33:22.529 --> 33:23.579
Although you

33:24.054 --> 33:25.704
have a lot of bad deeds,

33:26.279 --> 33:27.963
you've got a lot of guts.

33:28.904 --> 33:30.019
You have no bodyguards with you

33:30.043 --> 33:31.323
when meeting with people.

33:32.379 --> 33:33.379
Aren't you afraid of

33:34.129 --> 33:35.379
being assassinated?

33:41.729 --> 33:43.829
The assassin is also bold

33:44.929 --> 33:46.404
if he dares to do it here.

33:49.179 --> 33:50.404
For the sake of the people,

33:50.729 --> 33:52.259
I'd like to risk my life!

33:52.283 --> 33:53.084
Rebel,

33:53.129 --> 33:54.129
prepare to die!

34:13.404 --> 34:14.604
This is not finger method.

34:15.954 --> 34:17.204
It's not.

34:19.604 --> 34:21.154
Also not swordsmanship.

34:26.379 --> 34:27.829
It's marksmanship.

34:49.004 --> 34:49.941
I've always suspected that

34:49.965 --> 34:51.723
Xu Xiao hid a master by my side,

34:52.729 --> 34:54.524
and the first suspect is you.

34:55.629 --> 34:56.803
You took them in

34:56.854 --> 34:58.779
just to test me with her sword?

34:59.679 --> 35:00.883
I have to know

35:01.229 --> 35:03.004
the people around me.

35:04.629 --> 35:06.363
What if I'm not?

35:07.704 --> 35:08.779
I'm so smart.

35:08.803 --> 35:10.124
How can I guess wrong?

35:14.854 --> 35:17.004
Are you a dark minion or a death guard?

35:18.179 --> 35:19.484
Why don't you ask His Lordship?

35:19.754 --> 35:21.114
It would be boring if I asked him.

35:21.854 --> 35:23.524
It's more fun to find the people

35:23.954 --> 35:25.929
he planted around me.

35:30.079 --> 35:32.124
I'm thankful for you two this time.

35:32.554 --> 35:33.739
I take full responsibility
for the assassination.

35:33.763 --> 35:35.123
It has nothing to do with Mr. Lin.

35:36.629 --> 35:37.629
Does it?

35:39.004 --> 35:40.004
Mr. Lin,

35:41.154 --> 35:43.363
she said she arranged the assassination
on her own,

35:43.654 --> 35:44.763
and you were not involved.

35:45.279 --> 35:46.279
Is it true?

35:53.644 --> 35:56.444
You need to know that the person
who performed assassination against me

35:56.529 --> 35:58.554
in North Liang will be tortured.

35:59.504 --> 36:00.854
Soon,

36:01.729 --> 36:02.899
they will peel your skin

36:02.923 --> 36:04.524
without missing a piece,

36:05.129 --> 36:06.409
and it will be hung on the wall,

36:06.883 --> 36:08.484
fluttering in the wind.

36:08.684 --> 36:09.883
That feels quite ethereal.

36:20.404 --> 36:21.404
I…

36:21.704 --> 36:22.340
I…

36:22.364 --> 36:23.723
So you'd better think clearly

36:24.229 --> 36:25.554
before answering my question.

36:29.854 --> 36:31.294
It really has nothing to do with me.

36:33.079 --> 36:33.699
Is that so?

36:33.723 --> 36:34.723
Yes.

36:34.763 --> 36:36.203
You can look into it, Your Highness.

36:36.654 --> 36:37.859
I knew Miss Fan

36:37.883 --> 36:39.164
on my way up north.

36:39.729 --> 36:41.249
It was a real accidental acquaintance.

36:41.479 --> 36:43.164
I was tricked by her as well.

36:43.454 --> 36:45.779
I had no idea of her evil heart.

36:50.254 --> 36:51.564
Pick up the sword.

36:55.279 --> 36:56.454
Your Highness,

36:57.054 --> 36:59.243
I really didn't mean to assassinate you.

36:59.579 --> 37:01.140
I swear to God.

37:01.164 --> 37:02.164
Old Huang.

37:19.479 --> 37:21.919
She tricked the Third Graduate
in the Palace Examination, huh?

37:22.554 --> 37:23.804
So vicious.

37:23.923 --> 37:24.524
Yes,

37:24.754 --> 37:26.524
this woman is sinister and vicious.

37:32.804 --> 37:33.804
Take it.

37:40.354 --> 37:42.524
I didn't mean to assassinate you.

37:43.524 --> 37:44.980
I'm not asking you to stab me with it.

37:45.004 --> 37:46.129
I want you to kill her.

37:55.729 --> 37:56.763
Hold the sword steadily.

37:56.904 --> 37:57.754
Walk up to her,

37:57.879 --> 37:59.180
aim at her heart,

37:59.204 --> 38:00.244
and stab through her body.

38:00.524 --> 38:01.854
Remember to chop her ribs open.

38:02.254 --> 38:02.964
It's quite easy.

38:03.104 --> 38:04.104
Try it.

38:07.729 --> 38:08.729
Yes.

38:09.429 --> 38:11.029
After human skin is dried,

38:11.304 --> 38:12.554
it looks really nice

38:13.504 --> 38:14.679
on the wall.

38:17.954 --> 38:18.954
Yeah.

38:26.379 --> 38:27.379
Go.

38:49.479 --> 38:50.479
Yeah.

39:13.504 --> 39:14.804
I lied to you.

39:18.079 --> 39:19.379
I deserve it.

39:23.604 --> 39:24.604
Do it.

39:52.054 --> 39:53.379
Your Highness, I'm sorry.

39:53.403 --> 39:54.404
It was foolish of me.

39:54.629 --> 39:56.564
I read the books for nothing.

39:56.804 --> 39:58.955
The Xu family is the backbone
of our nation.

39:58.979 --> 40:00.580
I shouldn't have said the nonsense,

40:00.604 --> 40:01.554
and insulted you.

40:01.604 --> 40:02.660
I'm despicable.

40:02.684 --> 40:03.684
I'm foolish.

40:03.804 --> 40:04.804
I deserve to be beaten.

40:04.929 --> 40:05.763
I deserve to be beaten.

40:05.803 --> 40:06.339
I deserve to be beaten.

40:06.363 --> 40:07.100
I deserve it.

40:07.124 --> 40:07.859
I deserve to be beaten.

40:07.883 --> 40:08.379
I deserve it.

40:08.403 --> 40:09.020
I deserve it.

40:09.044 --> 40:10.044
I deserve it.

40:12.529 --> 40:13.729
You don't dare to kill anyone?

40:17.054 --> 40:18.204
You're a scholar.

40:18.329 --> 40:19.329
It's understandable.

40:22.654 --> 40:24.219
Thank you for understanding.

40:24.243 --> 40:26.164
But you don't have to slap yourself.

40:26.604 --> 40:27.644
You just insulted someone,

40:27.729 --> 40:28.955
it's not like you killed anyone.

40:28.979 --> 40:29.979
It's fine.

40:30.804 --> 40:32.604
Thank you for your benevolence.

40:34.379 --> 40:35.779
You don't dare to kill anyone,

40:35.979 --> 40:37.219
but do you dare to hit someone?

40:39.854 --> 40:41.054
She lied to you.

40:42.079 --> 40:43.959
How about you take it out on her
by hitting her?

40:55.679 --> 40:56.979
Or you can curse her.

40:58.954 --> 41:01.323
Do I hit her after cursing her?

41:01.729 --> 41:02.729
Suit yourself.

41:06.354 --> 41:07.803
You witch!

41:09.004 --> 41:10.779
I didn't expect you to be so sinister.

41:11.929 --> 41:13.460
I'm unsophisticated,

41:13.484 --> 41:14.803
and was tricked by her.

41:15.054 --> 41:15.900
Along the way,

41:15.924 --> 41:17.579
she defamed His Highness several times,

41:18.354 --> 41:20.179
so I was misled.

41:20.979 --> 41:21.979
You are…

41:22.443 --> 41:23.564
You are…

41:23.804 --> 41:24.700
You are such a…

41:24.724 --> 41:26.764
You don't know
how to use dirty words at this point?

41:28.454 --> 41:29.454
I do.

41:34.454 --> 41:35.684
Your mother

41:36.004 --> 41:37.644
failed to educate you!

41:39.104 --> 41:40.104
Enough.

41:40.354 --> 41:41.354
Fine!

41:46.363 --> 41:48.204
I can't watch this anymore.

41:54.329 --> 41:55.899
You saw

41:55.923 --> 41:57.044
what he has said and done.

41:58.004 --> 41:59.204
Do you resent him?

42:01.679 --> 42:02.964
I lied to him.

42:04.104 --> 42:05.254
Hitting or cursing,

42:05.679 --> 42:06.954
I deserve them both.

42:08.479 --> 42:09.479
I don't feel aggrieved.

42:13.729 --> 42:14.763
Women.

42:16.779 --> 42:17.954
Men.

42:20.079 --> 42:21.079
Mr. Lin,

42:21.554 --> 42:22.779
I now believe

42:22.803 --> 42:24.803
that you have nothing to do
with the assassination.

42:31.629 --> 42:32.729
Take her away.

42:34.604 --> 42:35.604
What?

42:35.829 --> 42:36.756
You're concerned that

42:36.780 --> 42:39.100
Mr. Lin might assassinate me again
when you're out of here?

42:42.479 --> 42:43.304
It's fine.

42:43.379 --> 42:44.379
Go.

44:57.004 --> 45:01.104
♪ The flower of pain ♪
